OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMorning fog patches soon
OL,6,Fclearing to leave a fine day with
OL,7,Fplenty of sunny spells, but the
OL,8,Fsunshine turning increasingly hazy
OL,9,Flater in the afternoon. Feeling
OL,10,Fpleasantly warm, though a fairly brisk
OL,11,Feasterly breeze developing towards the
OL,12,Fsouth coast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA fine evening for all, then
OL,15,Fdry overnight with lengthy clear
OL,16,Fspells. Breezy over the hills. Not
OL,17,Fquite as chilly as recent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
